<title>FINLAND: ORION SAYS 1996 REPORT DUE FEB 21, 0815.</title>
<headline>ORION SAYS 1996 REPORT DUE FEB 21, 0815.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals group Orion-Yhtyma Oy said on Tuesday that its preliminary 1996 earnings report would be published on Friday, February 21, at 0815/0615 GMT at a news conference in Helsinki.</p>
<p>The company had earlier said the report would be released at 0830/0630 GMT.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
